PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786520878
OL,3,CPerseid meteor shower to peak hours
OL,4,Cafter solar eclipse: When and how to
OL,5,Cwatch
OL,7,FThe best time to see the Perseids will
OL,8,Fbe in the early hours of Thursday
OL,9,Fmorning, between midnight and 5.30am.
OL,11,FBefore then, the solar eclipse will be
OL,12,Fvisible from the UK on Wednesday
OL,13,Fevening before sunset, while some
OL,14,FPerseid meteors could become visible
OL,15,Fshortly after sunset.
OL,17,FThe shower is expected to peak
OL,18,Fovernight on August 12 and 13, but
OL,19,Fwill remain active until August 24.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
